      "h": 296,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 30,
      "role": "body",
      "text": "<b>Wakefulness advisory:</b> compare direct EEG using independent events, false alerts/hour, delay and coverage.<br/><b>Regional feedback:</b> validate one patient ROI against paired fMRI, then test controlled benefit.<br/><b>Clinical precedent:</b> Prism's cleared adjunctive PTSD biofeedback excludes diagnostic interpretation [4].<br/><b>Current limits:</b> retrospective preprocessing, normalized targets, sparse ECG and one development site/seed. Live use and clinical benefit untested [5]."
